---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/')
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL.slice(0, -1)
  : import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section id="lua-hero" class="lua-hero-section">
  <!-- Ambient Glow & Lifestyle Backdrop -->
  <div class="hero-background-canvas" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="hero-lua-bg-stage">
      <img 
        src={`${baseUrl}/assets/valeria-lua-hero-bg.jpg?v=1`} 
        alt="Lúa, mascota STEAM de bloques con visor circular junto a interacción familiar y bloques manipulativos" 
        class="lua-artwork-img"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <div class="lua-overlay-gradient"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="glow-orb orb-orange"></div>
    <div class="glow-orb orb-cyan"></div>
    <div class="glow-orb orb-purple"></div>
    <div class="hero-grid-pattern"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container hero-content-wrapper">
    <!-- Top Intro Block -->
    <div class="hero-top-intro">
      <div class="lua-mascot-icon-wrapper">
        <img 
          src={`${baseUrl}/assets/valeria_lua.png`} 
          alt="Lúa la Gata - Mascota STEAM de bloques interactiva de Earlify Health" 
          class="lua-brand-icon" 
          width="105"
          height="105"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="editorial-eyebrow eyebrow-orange">
        <span>Mascota STEAM de Bloques · Cabeza V4 Circular · Versión V5 de Prueba</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-headline">
        Lúa: Mascota STEAM de Bloques <span class="gradient-text-orange">con Cabeza Electrónica Sellada</span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Cita Canónica Rectora -->
      <div class="canonical-axiom-banner">
        <p class="axiom-quote">
          «La app decide. Lúa reacciona. Los bloques los mueve el niño. El adulto media siempre.»
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="hero-narrative-lead">
        <strong>Lúa</strong> es la gata negra en píxel art de <strong>Valeria+</strong> y <strong>Descubre con Lúa</strong>, y también un juguete físico que el niño <strong>construye con sus manos</strong>. La cabeza versión 4 con placa oficial V1 circular (ESP32-C3 a 27 fps) es la <strong>única pieza electrónica</strong> de la mascota, sellada en fábrica por <strong>masque3d (Orense)</strong>. El cuerpo, los escenarios y los 6 mundos de Construye con Lúa se montan con bloques pasivos.
      </p>

      <!-- Shields Canónicos de Gobernanza -->
      <div class="hero-badge-pill-row">
        <span class="badge-pill pill-blue">C++17</span>
        <span class="badge-pill pill-cyan">Placa V1 Oficial · ESP32-C3 · 27 fps</span>
        <span class="badge-pill pill-teal">Eje Vertebrador STEAM</span>
        <span class="badge-pill pill-amber">V5 Bloques (En Diseño)</span>
        <span class="badge-pill pill-gray">Versión Robot Descartada</span>
        <span class="badge-pill pill-red">Sin Altavoz · Sin Micrófono</span>
        <span class="badge-pill pill-emerald">Zero-PHI Estructural</span>
        <span class="badge-pill pill-purple">🚀 startTIC · Zona Franca Vigo</span>
      </div>

      <div class="card-action-row">
        <button type="button" class="hero-btn btn-orange" data-open-contact>
          <span>Solicitar Información o Demo</span>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline></svg>
        </button>
        <a href="#sets-steam-construye" class="hero-btn btn-ghost">
          <span>Explorar los 6 Sets STEAM</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#decisiones-estado" class="hero-btn btn-ghost">
          <span>Estado y Decisiones (Oct 2026)</span>
        </a>
        <a href={`${baseUrl}/construye-con-lua`} class="hero-btn btn-ghost">
          <span>Ver Lúa Construye</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Showcase Grid: 3 Feature Cards + Interactive Circular Visor Canvas -->
    <div class="lua-showcase-grid">
      <div class="showcase-cards-col">
        <div class="lua-feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge icon-orange">🐱</div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <strong>Unidad Electrónica Sellada (Cabeza V4 + Placa V1)</strong>
            <p>Impresa e integrada en fábrica por <strong>masque3d (Orense)</strong>. Pantalla circular de 240×240 px a 27 fps, bloque-cuello con batería LiPo y anillo de 4 luces direccionales. El menor nunca manipula circuitos.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lua-feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge icon-cyan">🧱</div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <strong>Cuerpo de Bloques que Monta el Niño (V5)</strong>
            <p>Tronco, 4 patas y cola ensamblados con bloques pasivos, lavables, sin cables, sin imanes ni tornillos. Una sola postura anatómica correcta de acople (orientación mecánica forzada).</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lua-feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge icon-purple">✨</div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <strong>6 Mundos STEAM + Bloque Háptico Ronroneo</strong>
            <p>Interoperabilidad total entre sets. Opcional (≥ 3 años): bloque háptico Ronroneo externo con batería propia, garantizando físicamente el <strong>Silencio Clínico absoluto en VIA+</strong>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="showcase-device-col">
        <div class="lua-physical-device">
          <div class="device-bezel-outer">
            <!-- Anillo de 4 Luces Direccionales (Delante / Detrás / Izq / Dcha) -->
            <div class="bezel-led-ring" id="lua-led-ring" aria-label="Anillo de 4 luces direccionales de Lúa">
              <div class="led-directional led-front" id="led-front" title="Luz Delantera (Step Forward)">
                <span class="led-label">DELANTE</span>
              </div>
              <div class="led-directional led-back" id="led-back" title="Luz Trasera">
                <span class="led-label">DETRÁS</span>
              </div>
              <div class="led-directional led-left active" id="led-left" title="Luz Izquierda (Turn Left)">
                <span class="led-label">IZQ</span>
              </div>
              <div class="led-directional led-right" id="led-right" title="Luz Derecha (Turn Right)">
                <span class="led-label">DCHA</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="device-screen-circular">
              <canvas id="lua-hero-canvas" width="240" height="240" class="pixel-display-canvas"></canvas>
              <div class="screen-glare-overlay"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Interactive Light Controller Bar -->
          <div class="light-control-panel">
            <span class="control-panel-label">Simular Anillo de 4 Luces Direccionales (V5):</span>
            <div class="control-btn-group">
              <button type="button" class="ctrl-btn" data-light="left" title="Giro a la izquierda">⬅️ Izq</button>
              <button type="button" class="ctrl-btn" data-light="front" title="Avance frontal">⬆️ Delante</button>
              <button type="button" class="ctrl-btn" data-light="right" title="Giro a la derecha">➡️ Dcha</button>
              <button type="button" class="ctrl-btn" data-light="back" title="Orientación trasera">⬇️ Detrás</button>
              <button type="button" class="ctrl-btn ctrl-relax" data-light="relax" title="Modo Calm / Relax">💤 Relax</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="device-caption-row">
            <span class="device-badge">Unidad Sellada Lúa · Visor Circular 240×240 px · 27 fps · C++17</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  function initLuaCanvas() {
    const canvas = document.getElementById('lua-hero-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement;
    if (!canvas) return;
    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
    if (!ctx) return;

    const P = {
      BG: '#07090E',
      CAT_BODY: '#111827',
      CAT_HIGHLIGHT: '#1F2937',
      WHITE: '#FFFFFF',
      TURQUOISE: '#00F2FE',
      PINK: '#F472B6',
      GOLD: '#FBBF24',
      ORANGE: '#FB923C'
    };

    let frame = 0;

    function drawLuaCat() {
      frame++;
      ctx!.fillStyle = P.BG;
      ctx!.fillRect(0, 0, 240, 240);

      const scale = 8;
      const ox = 24;
      const oy = 24;

      // Suave respiración vertical
      const breathe = Math.sin(frame * 0.04) * 1.5;

      // Base cabeza de la gata negra
      ctx!.fillStyle = P.CAT_BODY;
      ctx!.fillRect(ox + 5 * scale, oy + 4 * scale + breathe, 14 * scale, 14 * scale);

      // Orejas
      ctx!.fillRect(ox + 4 * scale, oy + 2 * scale + breathe, 4 * scale, 4 * scale);
      ctx!.fillRect(ox + 16 * scale, oy + 2 * scale + breathe, 4 * scale, 4 * scale);

      // Interior orejas (rosa cálido)
      ctx!.fillStyle = P.PINK;
      ctx!.fillRect(ox + 5 * scale, oy + 3 * scale + breathe, 2 * scale, 2 * scale);
      ctx!.fillRect(ox + 17 * scale, oy + 3 * scale + breathe, 2 * scale, 2 * scale);

      // Ojos grandes píxel art turquesa con parpadeo periódico
      const isBlinking = (frame % 150 > 142);
      ctx!.fillStyle = P.TURQUOISE;
      if (isBlinking) {
        ctx!.fillRect(ox + 7 * scale, oy + 9 * scale + breathe, 3 * scale, 1 * scale);
        ctx!.fillRect(ox + 14 * scale, oy + 9 * scale + breathe, 3 * scale, 1 * scale);
      } else {
        ctx!.fillRect(ox + 7 * scale, oy + 7 * scale + breathe, 3 * scale, 4 * scale);
        ctx!.fillRect(ox + 14 * scale, oy + 7 * scale + breathe, 3 * scale, 4 * scale);

        // Brillo blanco en ojos
        ctx!.fillStyle = P.WHITE;
        ctx!.fillRect(ox + 7 * scale, oy + 7 * scale + breathe, 1 * scale, 1 * scale);
        ctx!.fillRect(ox + 14 * scale, oy + 7 * scale + breathe, 1 * scale, 1 * scale);
      }

      // Mejillas sonrosadas
      ctx!.fillStyle = P.PINK;
      ctx!.fillRect(ox + 5 * scale, oy + 11 * scale + breathe, 2 * scale, 1 * scale);
      ctx!.fillRect(ox + 17 * scale, oy + 11 * scale + breathe, 2 * scale, 1 * scale);

      // Naricilla naranja
      ctx!.fillStyle = P.ORANGE;
      ctx!.fillRect(ox + 11 * scale, oy + 10 * scale + breathe, 2 * scale, 1 * scale);

      // Boca tierna en W
      ctx!.fillStyle = P.WHITE;
      ctx!.fillRect(ox + 10 * scale, oy + 12 * scale + breathe, 1 * scale, 1 * scale);
      ctx!.fillRect(ox + 13 * scale, oy + 12 * scale + breathe, 1 * scale, 1 * scale);
      ctx!.fillRect(ox + 11 * scale, oy + 12.5 * scale + breathe, 2 * scale, 0.8 * scale);

      // Anillo circular de visualización con pulso sutil
      const glow = Math.sin(frame * 0.05) * 4 + 7;
      ctx!.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.75)';
      ctx!.lineWidth = 3;
      ctx!.shadowBlur = glow;
      ctx!.shadowColor = '#00F2FE';
      ctx!.beginPath();
      ctx!.arc(120, 120, 112, 0, Math.PI * 2);
      ctx!.stroke();
      ctx!.shadowBlur = 0;

      requestAnimationFrame(drawLuaCat);
    }

    drawLuaCat();

    // Controlador interactivo de luces direccionales
    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.light-control-panel .ctrl-btn');
    const leds = {
      front: document.getElementById('led-front'),
      back: document.getElementById('led-back'),
      left: document.getElementById('led-left'),
      right: document.getElementById('led-right')
    };

    buttons.forEach(btn => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const target = btn.dataset.light;
        buttons.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
        btn.classList.add('active');

        // Reset lights
        Object.values(leds).forEach(l => l?.classList.remove('active', 'relax'));

        if (target === 'relax') {
          Object.values(leds).forEach(l => l?.classList.add('relax'));
        } else if (target && leds[target as keyof typeof leds]) {
          leds[target as keyof typeof leds]?.classList.add('active');
        }
      });
    });
  }

  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initLuaCanvas);
  } else {
    initLuaCanvas();
  }
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initLuaCanvas);
</script>

<style>
  .lua-hero-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 8.5rem 0 5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: var(--bg-dark);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-background-canvas {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .hero-lua-bg-stage {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    opacity: 0.55;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .lua-artwork-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 40%;
    display: block;
    filter: brightness(0.72) contrast(1.1) saturate(1.15);
  }

  .lua-overlay-gradient {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, rgba(7, 9, 14, 0.4) 0%, rgba(7, 9, 14, 0.88) 75%, var(--bg-dark) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .glow-orb {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(90px);
    opacity: 0.25;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .orb-orange {
    width: 560px;
    height: 560px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #f97316 0%, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0) 70%);
    top: -100px;
    left: -120px;
  }

  .orb-cyan {
    width: 520px;
    height: 520px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #00F2FE 0%, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0) 70%);
    bottom: -100px;
    right: -100px;
  }

  .orb-purple {
    width: 420px;
    height: 420px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #8A2BE2 0%, rgba(138, 43, 226, 0) 70%);
    top: 30%;
    left: 45%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    opacity: 0.15;
  }

  .hero-grid-pattern {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: 
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, black 30%, transparent 80%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, black 30%, transparent 80%);
    z-index: 3;
  }

  .hero-content-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .hero-top-intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
  }

  .lua-mascot-icon-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 0 auto 1.25rem auto;
  }

  .lua-brand-icon {
    width: 96px;
    height: 96px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.45), 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    display: block;
    animation: floatIcon 4s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes floatIcon {
    0% { transform: translateY(0px); }
    100% { transform: translateY(-6px); }
  }

  .editorial-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .eyebrow-orange { color: #fb923c; }

  .hero-headline {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.2vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .gradient-text-orange {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 20%, #fb923c 80%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .canonical-axiom-banner {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .axiom-quote {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.18rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fed7aa;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .hero-narrative-lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.6vw, 1.22rem);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem auto;
  }

  .hero-narrative-lead strong {
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .hero-badge-pill-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.85rem;
  }

  .badge-pill {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .pill-blue {
    background: rgba(0, 89, 156, 0.2);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 89, 156, 0.5);
    color: #60a5fa;
  }

  .pill-cyan {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.35);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .pill-teal {
    background: rgba(0, 196, 190, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 196, 190, 0.4);
    color: #2dd4bf;
  }

  .pill-amber {
    background: rgba(240, 165, 0, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(240, 165, 0, 0.4);
    color: #fbbf24;
  }

  .pill-gray {
    background: rgba(138, 138, 138, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(138, 138, 138, 0.35);
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .pill-red {
    background: rgba(179, 38, 30, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(179, 38, 30, 0.4);
    color: #fca5a5;
  }

  .pill-emerald {
    background: rgba(10, 125, 84, 0.2);
    border: 1px solid rgba(10, 125, 84, 0.45);
    color: #6ee7b7;
  }

  .pill-purple {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);
    color: #D8B4FE;
  }

  .card-action-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }

  .btn-orange {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316 0%, #fb923c 100%);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.4);
  }

  .btn-orange:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.6);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .lua-showcase-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .showcase-cards-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.15rem;
  }

  .lua-feature-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    padding: 1.35rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .lua-feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    border-color: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.4);
  }

  .feature-icon-badge {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .icon-orange {
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.4);
  }

  .icon-cyan {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
  }

  .icon-purple {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
  }

  .feature-text strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .feature-text p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .showcase-device-col {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .lua-physical-device {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 360px;
  }

  .device-bezel-outer {
    position: relative;
    width: 290px;
    height: 290px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #1E293B 0%, #0F172A 70%, #020617 100%);
    border: 8px solid #334155;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 60px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9), 0 0 45px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.25);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 14px;
  }

  .bezel-led-ring {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

